# 📊 Sample Results

The model successfully detects multiple object categories including:

- 🚗 Cars
- 🚌 Buses
- 🚦 Traffic lights
- 🦒 Giraffes
- Additional COCO dataset classes

Example output images are available in the `outputs/` directory.

